{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00261",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 4.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.16,
      "end_seconds": 9.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.14,
      "end_seconds": 18.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "It's a routine check-up, mostly. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.01,
      "end_seconds": 19.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.26,
      "end_seconds": 25.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 25.7,
      "end_seconds": 30.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.38,
      "end_seconds": 33.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.05,
      "end_seconds": 35.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "And occasional tiredness, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.49,
      "end_seconds": 41.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "What about mild headaches now and then, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.29,
      "end_seconds": 43.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.67,
      "end_seconds": 46.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any chest pain or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.59,
      "end_seconds": 59.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "No, no chest pain, no low mood. I did have a few skipped meals at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.62,
      "end_seconds": 61.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Has there been any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.99,
      "end_seconds": 66.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Um, no, I haven't had any weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.73,
      "end_seconds": 69.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Any persistent cough or blood in the stool at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.7,
      "end_seconds": 74.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Well, no, no persistent cough or blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.85,
      "end_seconds": 78.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.66,
      "end_seconds": 82.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.64,
      "end_seconds": 87.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.36,
      "end_seconds": 88.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 89.97,
      "end_seconds": 97.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse 75. BP is 122 over 82, temp 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.87,
      "end_seconds": 115.58,
      "duration_seconds": 16.71,
      "text": "Thanks. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.64,
      "end_seconds": 118.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.45,
      "end_seconds": 126.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.51,
      "end_seconds": 129.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Yeah, my father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.29,
      "end_seconds": 134.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.04,
      "end_seconds": 137.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.34,
      "end_seconds": 144.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.0,
      "end_seconds": 163.27,
      "duration_seconds": 18.27,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar. I just want to get back to normal, really. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. Okay, so I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 164.27,
      "end_seconds": 168.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.81,
      "end_seconds": 172.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.23,
      "end_seconds": 180.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I mean, I take telmisartan, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.39,
      "end_seconds": 183.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.13,
      "end_seconds": 191.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "40 milligrams. Sumatriptan. I take it 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.16,
      "end_seconds": 195.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "So, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.8,
      "end_seconds": 196.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.53,
      "end_seconds": 211.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.16,
      "end_seconds": 241.13,
      "duration_seconds": 27.97,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year. Yeah, I've had high cholesterol for two years now. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. Um, um, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I've had migraines, yes. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.44,
      "end_seconds": 249.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "Alright. Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.24,
      "end_seconds": 261.45,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.53,
      "end_seconds": 266.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.62,
      "end_seconds": 271.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "No, um, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.11,
      "end_seconds": 276.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.04,
      "end_seconds": 287.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, um, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.29,
      "end_seconds": 291.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.34,
      "end_seconds": 293.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.02,
      "end_seconds": 304.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.06,
      "end_seconds": 309.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Right, can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.6,
      "end_seconds": 312.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.93,
      "end_seconds": 331.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with no tenderness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.16,
      "end_seconds": 334.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.45,
      "end_seconds": 349.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Heart and lung sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.52,
      "end_seconds": 378.38,
      "duration_seconds": 25.86,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like generally well, nothing worrying today. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be a tendency towards high cholesterol, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.18,
      "end_seconds": 381.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.84,
      "end_seconds": 390.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now generally well, nothing worrying today is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.85,
      "end_seconds": 394.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.24,
      "end_seconds": 396.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.11,
      "end_seconds": 413.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. We should do an HbA1c for health screening. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 413.95,
      "end_seconds": 416.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "The earliest is Tuesday, 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.55,
      "end_seconds": 425.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for health screening. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.61,
      "end_seconds": 429.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 429.97,
      "end_seconds": 453.65,
      "duration_seconds": 23.68,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a lipid profile for health screening. Keep up regular exercise, around a hundred and fifty minutes a week, and go easy on processed food. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 455.01,
      "end_seconds": 461.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.09,
      "end_seconds": 464.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 465.28,
      "end_seconds": 471.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 472.39,
      "end_seconds": 473.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 474.67,
      "end_seconds": 478.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 479.45,
      "end_seconds": 480.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 481.44,
      "end_seconds": 485.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 486.62,
      "end_seconds": 492.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 493.24,
      "end_seconds": 498.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 498.65,
      "end_seconds": 503.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    }
  ]
}